Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎有人想叛离忍者村
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,首领已亲自命令我杀掉可疑分子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不久后应该也会收到命令
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.67,0:00:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 不管是谁 我都不会放过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,即便对方是你重要的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里获得了名字 找到了荣誉和活着的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这里能容下我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要作为忍者成就大义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,威胁大义者…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都该被肃清
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经做了力所能及的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,就算现在不行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 在也会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,该下决心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,雷公驱云散 今日不敢鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,奥义 迅雷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕你能复活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会无数次杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,朝阳起 湖面平静泛波光
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,执桨行舟亦无痕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,奥义 幽静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他把五感提升到了极限…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 还要更高
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你本就知道那两人会叛逃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么放走他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,答不上来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,当了叛忍 被追杀是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是你自找的 彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你轻视戒律和大义
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就不会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有轻视
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是想明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不存在即便舍弃所爱之物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,舍弃想保护的事物也要遵守的戒律
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也不存在必须成就的大义
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾说过只有村子能容下你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.10,0:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是村子已容不下我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那为什么要立下盟约
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要说那种谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们同行 能看到不同的景色吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一起前行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我第一次相信自己有了同伴 有了朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你背叛的不仅是村子 还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我们而言也很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那个花纹…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了不忘记你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直在追寻 和你说过的不同的景色…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,又想骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会停下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须终结忍者 终结你所重视的这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才要向你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来证明一下谁是对的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,用实践来证明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,向你展示我所相信的正确
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 肯定… 没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠说过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算让他得偿所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不管他是出于戒律 还是仇恨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:08:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但不论如何 都得请他放过莲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,莲肯定能让在看到不同的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小生命会让他明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也能够拥有自己的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在 有朝一日为彼此的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.89,0:08:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,做个了结吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 没有办法吗 没有办法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别吓我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那你上锁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,烤鸭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.62,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,跑去以前忍者待过的废墟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚走 就有战书寄来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,战书? 谁下的?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 这时搞这一出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你那个想法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 事态恶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,追兵马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,数据呢 到手了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,找到存在哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还没好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,下一步就需要艾玛的生物特征认证了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我试了很多办法 都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我也调查过后面的实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别说指纹了 一根头发都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她简直是透明人 行走的加密软件
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拿不到数据 之前做的一切都会白费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别冲我发火
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要喝点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要久违地喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,画得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得它是诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但有时它说不定会成为你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 很抱歉突然打电话来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有点事想和你说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得第一次见面时的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,当时国防部长告诉我 让忍者当我的护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是恶劣的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.43,0:10:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们做事利索
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不夹杂任何感情的高专业素养
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,让我深受感动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:11:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才接受了你们想制造具足装备的提议
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 测试并发展我司的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那样是最理想的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.22,0:11:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很有趣 我很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但你似乎不那么想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,目前的情况不是很乐观
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,具足装备和反应堆的开发数据已到手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以自主建设产线了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,时机已到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我看不透你打的什么算盘?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是把改变世界挂在嘴边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但还没说过具体怎么个改法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,山路 我是厌倦了这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,只要得到{\fsp8}了{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}开发的奇迹般的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,世界就会大幅改变
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,人们的生活将变得格外丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,各种问题都会得到解决
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,同样地 战争也会改变
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,武器的威力会提升 以往的常识将被颠覆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.58,0:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的控制下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,人类将迈向下一个阶梯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应会好好使用你们的数据
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别了 山路
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不论哪件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.61,0:13:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.84,0:14:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,发现嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.14,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,正{\fsp8}在{\r}1{\fsp8}6{\r}号公路上向西北方逃窜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,请求增援
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫先生 请走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要杀您的话 我早动手了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 楼顶有直升机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,直接去实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把车停下 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,下来 双手放到地上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,之后就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面有艾玛的指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,追兵已经来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我来争取时间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只是要赌一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经能看{\fsp8}到{\r}CE{\fsp8}O{\r}大人那张苦瓜脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.55,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,身后交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.33,0:17:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,请您放松
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就算没打中 我也会想办法搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比{\fsp8}起{\r}FP{\fsp8}S{\r}游戏 还是实战更好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你那套可改变不了世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你也相当傲慢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉 你也要背叛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不是您命令我来保护约瑟夫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那你试试把命令执行到底
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,迪… 莉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.45,0:20:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这次新找出了两个人的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一个是彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个是鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的孩子 也得杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是为了大义
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在 能下手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢星星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,并不是 只是这样能让我想起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,从前太弱小 只能一直盯着地面的时日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,以此警示自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的忍者都有着不幸的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.99,0:21:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可我不想总被诅咒般的过往束缚住
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,过往不会消失不见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们能自行改变看事物的角度
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该也能放下过往 注视着未来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是未来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.38,0:21:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 但感觉总有一天我会明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.23,0:21:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那或许就是不同的景色吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,最好如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠说过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,莲肯定能让在看到不同的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.41,0:22:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这个小生命会让他明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.52,0:22:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也能够拥有自己的未来
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}注：出自万叶集 卷十九 4235
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}注：出自拾玉集 第四 5106
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.91,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Comment: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.24,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Comment: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:55.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Comment: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:00.26,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Comment: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.93,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Comment: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:12.85,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Comment: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:17.40,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:22.61,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Comment: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:27.91,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Comment: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:33.04,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Comment: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:38.38,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Comment: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:43.05,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:46.02,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Comment: 0,0:21:46.53,0:21:50.24,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Comment: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:55.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Comment: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:00.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Comment: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:07.93,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Comment: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:12.85,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Comment: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:17.40,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Comment: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:22.61,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Comment: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:27.91,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Comment: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:33.04,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Comment: 0,0:22:33.41,0:22:38.38,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Comment: 0,0:22:39.04,0:22:43.05,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:46.02,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
